export anchor RuggedRadioStyle:
    number: 349
    screen: TeamChat
    name: Rugged radio
    idea: The chat as a rugged field handset, with a rubber housing, a channel knob and chunky rocker keys around a black screen that logs every message as an RX or TX transmission, and one safety orange for the live channel and Send.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #111213, behind the handset and the style sheet
        rubber: #232528, the housing and sheet cards
        rubber2: #2e3135, inset panels and key tops
        edge: #4a4e54, moulded rims and key edges
        screen: #0a0b0c, the message screen and fields
        ink: #eceae4, text
        muted: #a9adb3, times, labels and channel numbers
        orange: #ff8a1f, the live channel, Send, TX and focus, with text #1f0e00
        amber: #ffb45c, panel labels, RX and typing
        green: #7fe08a, the MSG count tag and in range bars
        red: #ff7b6b, the CALL mention tag
    type:
        A condensed sans, Roboto Condensed, Arial Narrow, DejaVu Sans
        Condensed, Liberation Sans Narrow, with font stretch condensed,
        plus a monospace, ui-monospace, DejaVu Sans Mono, Menlo, Consolas,
        for readouts. Base 15px. Screen title 24px at 800 in capitals,
        names 13px at 800 capitals tracked 0.06em, message text 16px,
        readouts and tags 11px to 12px mono bold.
    layout:
        The whole app is one handset, a rubber housing with 28px corners,
        a 2px moulded edge, inset highlights and two screw heads in the top
        corners. A top bar holds BRIGHTWORK in orange with CHAT, a mono
        model line naming operator Mara Okafor, and two LEDs with Link up
        and RX. Two columns, 300px of controls and the screen. The control
        column stacks three inset panels with amber mono labels. Channel
        selector shows a drawn knob pointing at channel 2 beside Tuned to
        CH 2, design-crit. Channels are five rocker keys numbered CH 1 to
        CH 5 with a hard ledge below, the current one solid orange with an
        ON AIR tag, mobile-release with a green triangle 4 MSG tag,
        billing-war-room with a red @ 1 CALL tag. Direct lines shows
        signal bars, full for Priya with In range, two of three for Jonas
        with Standby, crossed out for Aiko with Out of range. The screen is
        a black well with an inset shadow, titled CH 2 and design-crit in
        orange over a dashed rule. Each message is a transmission row with
        a 4px left bar, a mono RX or TX and the time, then the name in
        capitals and the text. Mara's row is TX with an orange bar. Aiko's
        row adds keys for Thread, 3 replies in orange and Thumbs up 3 and
        Eyes 1. The image is a small preview with an IMAGE tag and the
        filename. A radio wave icon with Priya is typing ends the screen.
        Under both columns a keypad row holds Attach and Emoji rocker
        keys, the field in a black well and a wide orange Send key. Below
        860px everything stacks and Send spans the row.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px housing padding, 20px between panels, 10px between transmissions.
    density: Medium. Large touch keys around a compact log.
    corners: 28px housing, 16px panels and Send, 10px to 12px keys, round screws and LEDs.
    borders: A 2px moulded edge on the housing, 1px edges on keys, a 4px left bar on each transmission.
    shadows: Hard 3px to 5px ledges under keys, an inset well around the screen and a deep drop under the housing.
    icons: Thick 2.4 stroke line icons. Presence as signal bars, full, two of three or crossed out, beside the words.
    focus: A 3px safety orange outline offset 3px.
    tone: Radio talk, such as ON AIR, 4 MSG, 1 CALL, In range, Standby and Out of range.
